  # An infix operator has the same spacing on both sides, and a postfix,
  # a member `.`, an enum literal's `.`, and an open range's `..` touch
  # what they join: spacing that reads one way and is parsed another is
  # rejected, each case with the text to write. Every case in the file is
  # reported, once the source parses.

